      "id": "claim_ca615b4552f04707a7ef316d738e6ed0",
      "statement": "step path prints the configured step path: the base path defaults to $HOME/.step and can be overridden with the STEPPATH environment variable; with a selected context it returns the per-authority path ($STEPPATH/authorities/<authority>); --base prints step.BasePath() and --profile prints step.ProfilePath().",
